ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service
Architecture Specification v1.0 — Hausa working draft
Matsayi: Ƙa'idar ƙira kawai (design-only; ba a aiwatar da komai ba)
Ranar: 10 Oktoba 2026
Yanayi: Mainnet ga jama'a; Testnet na cikin gida domin QA
Dokar canji: Babu code, migration, Storage, permission ko production change a wannan mataki.
1. Manufa da abin da bincike ya tabbatar
Wannan takarda ta bayyana yadda ALBUKHR Pi dApp Launch Service ya kamata ya yi aiki kafin a fara gyara ko gina shi.
Binciken repo na albukhr-app ya nuna cewa akwai shafukan Services, Pi dApp Service, Policy da My dApp Requests, amma wasu scripts da shafukan suke kira ba su cikin reshen main da aka duba: js/pi-auth.js, js/supabase.js, js/pi-dapp-engine.js, da js/my-dapp-requests.js. Saboda haka, idan production yana amfani da wannan reshe kai tsaye, aika buƙata da lissafin buƙatun mai amfani na iya kasa aiki. Har yanzu ba a tabbatar da wannan ta live-browser test ba, kuma production na iya bambanta da main.
Binciken Supabase na Mainnet da Testnet bai gano teburi, RPC ko Storage bucket da aka keɓe musamman ga wannan dApp service ba. Haka kuma, babu cikakken Admin workflow na wannan sabis da aka gano a Admin repo. Wannan yana nuna cewa ya kamata a ƙirƙiri ƙirar data da workflow da gangan maimakon dogaro da tsohon engine da ba a tabbatar da shi ba.
Shawarar da aka amince da ita
Mainnet: shi ne kawai hanyar da jama'a za su yi amfani da ita don neman sabis.
Testnet: na cikin gida ne don gwajin UI, request lifecycle, fayiloli, Admin workflow da network isolation kafin fitar da sauye-sauye.
Warewa: a yi amfani da Mainnet da Testnet Supabase projects daban, API configuration daban, Storage daban, da network field da server-side validation a matsayin kariya ta biyu.
Babu canjin live environment: ba za a yi deployment ko migration ba sai bayan an amince da ƙira, an kammala implementation plan, kuma an ba da izini a fili.
2. Abubuwan da wannan sabis zai yi
Ya ƙunsa
Nuna nau'in sabis da bayanansa.
Ba authenticated Pi user damar fara buƙata, adana draft, cike bayanai, loda rasit/takardu idan an buƙata, sannan ya aika.
Ba mai amfani damar ganin buƙatunsa da matsayin da ya kai.
Ba Admin mai izini damar duba buƙata, tabbatar da bayanan biyan kuɗi, neman gyara, amincewa/ƙin karɓa, tsara aikin, da rubuta sakamakon/deliverables.
Ajiye tarihin canje-canje domin audit trail.
Gwada dukkan tsarin a Testnet ba tare da haɗa bayanan jama'a ba.
Ba ya ƙunsa a wannan lokaci
Ba ya ba da tabbacin cewa dApp zai samu amincewar Pi Network, kasuwa, masu amfani ko kuɗaɗen shiga.
Ba ya ƙaddamar da app a Pi Developer Portal kai tsaye sai an ƙirƙiri irin wannan aikin dabam kuma an tabbatar da ikon samun damar yin hakan.
Ba ya gudanar da investment, staking ko sarrafa kuɗin masu amfani.
Ba ya ɗaukar cewa duk wani receipt upload yana nufin an biya kuɗi.
Ba ya ƙirƙirar sabon hanyar Pi login; zai haɗu da tsarin ALBUKHR Pi auth na yanzu bayan an tabbatar da API contract ɗinsa.
3. Muhimman abubuwan da har yanzu suke buƙatar shawarar mai aikin
Kada a hard-code waɗannan abubuwa a cikin code har sai an yanke hukunci:
Batu
Abin da aka gani
Shawarar ƙira / abin da za a tabbatar
Farashi
UI yana nuna ₦35,000 don Pi Studio Assistance da ₦500,000 don Developer-built dApp, amma wasu rubutu suna cewa farashi mai sassauci.
Admin-managed service catalog ne zai zama authoritative; a tabbatar da farashi, currency, da ko ana iya canza quote kafin implementation.
Hanyar biyan kuɗi
Form yana da receipt reference da receipt image.
A tabbatar ko ana karɓar bank transfer, Pi payment, ko hanyoyi biyu. Kada receipt ya zama payment_confirmed kai tsaye.
Lokacin aiki
Ba a tabbatar da SLA/timeline ba.
A bayyana estimated turnaround, abin da zai iya jinkirta aikin, da lokacin da clock zai fara.
Gyara da refund
Policy ɗin da aka duba ba ta fayyace cikakken revision/refund/cancellation process ba.
A amince da adadin gyare-gyare, cancellation, refund eligibility da yadda za a warware saɓani.
Abin da ake miƙawa
“Launch service” na iya nufin taimako, development ko launch support daban-daban.
A rubuta deliverables da iyakokin kowanne service type.
Mallaka da takardun sirri
Policy tana tattauna ownership amma cikakkun retention/support details ba su cika ba.
A fayyace ownership, confidentiality, data retention, support bayan delivery, da alhakin user na secrets/keys.
Muhimmi: har sai an tabbatar, farashin da ke yanzu a UI ba za a ɗauke shi a matsayin ƙa'idar server ko tabbacin kuɗin da ake biya ba.
4. Manyan sassan gine-gine
4.1 User interface — App repo
Shafuka da ake tsammanin za a gyara ko maye gurbin scripts ɗinsu:
services.html / js/services.js — katalogi da hanyar shiga.
pi-dapp-service.html — fom ɗin buƙata da consent.
pi-dapp-policy.html — policy da sharuddan sabis.
my-dapp-requests.html — tarihin buƙatun mai amfani da cikakken matsayi.
Sabbin modules idan an buƙata, amma a fara da small, scoped change set.
Shafuka su yi amfani da js/core/pi-auth-core.js, js/core/supabase-core.js da js/core/environment-core.js maimakon legacy scripts da ba su wanzu a reshen da aka duba. Kada a yi localStorage ko sessionStorage amfani wajen ajiyar login, Pi UID, session ko matsayin izini. Ajiya ta ɗan lokaci a UI ba za ta zama madogarar gaskiya ba; drafts da request records su kasance a database.
4.2 Trusted API boundary
Duk wani aiki mai tasiri — ƙirƙira/gyara request, ƙaddamarwa, loda/haɗa takarda, tabbatar da biyan kuɗi, canza matsayin Admin, da fitar da deliverable — ya bi trusted server endpoint ko RPC mai kariya.
Kafin a zaɓi ainihin endpoint, a bincika ALBUKHR API gateway na yanzu da external-project gateway domin gano abin da za a iya sake amfani da shi ba tare da haɗa permissions ko lalata sauran ayyuka ba.
API/server ya kamata:
tabbatar da Pi access token ta hanyar Pi API (/v2/me) ko ingantaccen tsarin ALBUKHR server auth;
ya samo verified user identity a server, ba daga pi_uid, user_id, network ko is_admin da browser ya aika ba;
ya tabbatar da network ɗin request ya dace da server/project ɗin da aka kai;
ya duba ownership, service type, price/quote version, files da halaccin canjin status;
ya ƙirƙiri audit event ga muhimman canje-canje;
ya guji ɗora server key, Supabase service-role key ko Pi Server API Key a browser.
4.3 Database — Supabase
A yi amfani da Supabase Core guda ɗaya ga browser, amma kada a ba browser damar canza abubuwan da ke buƙatar babban izini kai tsaye. Abubuwan da za a buƙaci su kasance server-controlled za su bi trusted API/RPC.
