Ka'idojin database
A samu foreign keys, indexes kan owner_user_id, status, created_at, request_id, da fields da ake yawan bincika.
A yi check constraints ko server-side validation kan enumerated values; kada a dogara da validation na HTML.
quote_snapshot ya adana abin da aka nuna wa user lokacin submit, don canjin farashi na gaba kada ya canza tsohon request.
A ware status da payment_status: buƙata na iya kasancewa under_review ba tare da an tabbatar da kuɗi ba.
A saka network a records masu dacewa ko da an ware projects, a matsayin kariya ta biyu da audit metadata.
Kada a kwafi production data zuwa Testnet. Yi synthetic/test users da fake/sandbox payment references.
A tantance RLS da grants a kan kowane tebur kafin deploy. Idan an tsara duk write/read ta trusted service, kada a ƙara browser grants kawai domin sauƙaƙa UI. RLS/policies/SQL privileges su dace da ainihin hanyar samun bayanai.
4.4 Storage
A ƙirƙiri bucket na musamman ga dApp service a lokacin implementation kawai idan an amince. Ya kamata ya kasance private, tare da object path da ke ɗauke da request ID da network scope.
A tabbatar da file type ta MIME da file signature, ba extension kawai ba.
A sa iyakar file size, adadin attachments da accepted file types a configuration.
A hana public listing da anonymous access.
A fitar da temporary signed URL bayan tabbatar da ownership/role kawai.
A ware Mainnet bucket daga Testnet bucket ta project/configuration; kada Testnet URL ya taɓa Mainnet file.
Rasit da takardun sirri kada su kasance a public bucket ko link marar expiration.
Ba a amince da takamaiman size/type limits na dApp service ba tukuna; a yanke hukunci kafin implementation.
5. Matsayin buƙata (Request lifecycle)
An tsara waɗannan matsayin a matsayin baseline. A tabbatar da final business rules kafin a ƙirƙiri database enum/constraints.
draft — an fara buƙata amma user bai aika ba.
submitted — server ya tabbatar cewa required fields/consent sun cika.
under_review — Admin yana duba bukatar da scope.
needs_revision — an mayar wa user da dalili/abubuwan gyarawa.
accepted — an yarda da scope; ba yana nufin an biya ba, ko an fara aiki ba.
awaiting_payment — an ƙayyade quote/invoice kuma ana jiran hanyar biyan kuɗi da aka amince da ita.
payment_under_review — an aika proof/transaction, ana tabbatarwa.
payment_confirmed — trusted server/provider ko Admin mai izini ya tabbatar da kuɗi.
queued — buƙata ta shirya kuma tana jiran fara aiki.
in_progress — ana gudanar da aikin.
delivered — an miƙa deliverables ga user.
completed — an tabbatar da completion bisa policy.
rejected / cancelled — buƙata ta ƙare ba tare da ci gaba ba; a rubuta dalili.
refund_requested / refunded (idan refunds suna cikin scope) — a ware su daga cancellation status.
Ka'idojin state transition
Server ne kawai zai tabbatar da transition; kada a bar browser ya rubuta status kai tsaye.
Kowane transition yana da allow-list na daga-wane-zuwa-wane, actor mai izini, dalili idan ya dace, da audit event.
payment_confirmed ba zai fito daga karɓar receipt image kawai ba.
accepted ba daidai yake da active, queued ko in_progress ba.
Admin ba zai kammala aikin ba tare da rubuta deliverables/close-out metadata ba, idan aka amince da wannan requirement.
A tanadi idempotency ga submit da payment confirmation, domin double-click/retry kada su haifar da duplicate request ko duplicate payment.
6. Biyan kuɗi da quote
A fara da tabbatar da business model. Akwai hanyoyi biyu masu bambanci:
A. Manual/external transfer: user ya shigar da reference kuma ya ɗora receipt; status zai kasance payment_under_review har sai Admin/financial verifier ya tabbatar daga sahihin source. Receipt ba hujjar ƙarshe ba ce.
B. Pi Platform payment: idan za a karɓi Pi ta SDK/API, dole a aiwatar da tsarin payment verification/complete server-side bisa takardun Pi na yanzu. Kada a dogara da callback na browser ko transaction hash da user ya shigar shi kaɗai. A ware payment attempt, server verification, completion/settlement da idempotency.
Kada a haɗa waɗannan hanyoyin a matsayin hanya guda ba tare da rubuta takamaiman payment workflow ba. Hakanan, kada a nuna NGN farashi kamar Pi amount ne; amount da currency dole su kasance filaye dabam.
7. Admin workflow da tsaro
Binciken Admin repo bai gano dedicated Pi dApp service pages ko service-specific RPCs ba. Don haka a tsara workflow a Admin repo a matsayin module mai zaman kansa, ba a cikin admin-external-projects ba.
Ƙa'idodi
A sake amfani da tsarin Admin auth da MFA/AAL2 na yanzu (supabase-admin-auth.js, albukhr-mfa.js) inda ya dace; kada a ƙirƙiri login/MFA na biyu.
A ayyana dedicated permission, misali dapp_service_admin da kuma payment-verifier role idan wajibi ne, ta hanyar tsarin permission da aka tabbatar a repo/database. Sunayen nan shawara ne, ba roles da aka ƙirƙira ba.
Server-side RPC/endpoint ne zai enforce role da AAL2; duba role a frontend kaɗai bai isa ba.
A bambanta permissions: request review, payment verification, service delivery, policy/catalog administration. A guji mutum ɗaya ya amince da duk abin da ke buƙatar separation of duties idan tsarin kasuwanci ya buƙata.
Kada a canza Dock Navigation ko sauran Admin modules a cikin wannan aikin; ƙara hanyar shiga da ke da iyaka idan an amince.
Admin Mainnet ba zai iya rubuta Testnet records ta hanyar canza network a request ba. Testnet QA na Admin yana buƙatar environment da izini da aka tsara a fili, ba amfani da production session wajen gwajin bayanai ba.
