9. Audit trail, privacy da bayanan sirri
A adana abubuwan da ake buƙata kaɗai; kada a rubuta access token, API key, password, Pi Server API Key ko cikakken sirrin mai amfani a logs.
Audit events su ƙunshi actor, action, timestamp, record ID, state transition da reason; kada su zama hanyar adana duk takardun user.
A bayyana privacy notice: nau'in bayanan da ake tattarawa, manufarsu, wanda ke iya gani, retention, da hanyar neman gyara ko sharewa idan policy ta yarda.
A fayyace yadda ake sarrafa secrets/keys na dApp. A ƙa'ida, mai amfani bai kamata ya ɗora private key, seed phrase ko secret token ba; UI/policy su yi gargadi a sarari.
A tsara retention/deletion policy kafin go-live; kada a bar rasit/takardu har abada ba tare da manufa ba.
10. Acceptance criteria kafin Mainnet release
Release bai kamata ya wuce ba sai duk abubuwan da suka dace sun tabbata:
[ ]
Dukkan legacy script references an cire su ko an tabbatar da cewa suna wanzuwa a production, kuma an yi browser test.
[ ]
Pi auth yana amfani da shared AlbukhrPiAuth; babu localStorage/sessionStorage a matsayin madogarar identity.
[ ]
Server ya tabbatar da user identity da request ownership.
[ ]
Database schema, constraints, RLS da SQL grants an duba su; babu direct browser writes da ke iya ƙetare business rules.
[ ]
Testnet request ba zai bayyana ko rubuta Mainnet ba, ko ta UI ko API/RPC.
[ ]
Mainnet request ba zai taɓa Testnet Storage/API ba.
[ ]
Unauthorized user ba zai karanta request/files na wani user ba.
[ ]
Unauthorized Admin ko session mara AAL2 ba zai gudanar da privileged action ba.
[ ]
Upload limits/type checks, private access, signed URL expiry da ownership checks suna aiki.
[ ]
Receipt upload ba ya tabbatar da payment ta atomatik.
[ ]
Payment verification idempotent ne; duplicate event/retry ba ya tabbatar da kuɗi sau biyu.
[ ]
Consent/Policy gate yana tilasta amincewa kafin submission; an adana version/time na consent.
[ ]
Draft, revision, rejection, cancellation da completion suna da gwaje-gwaje.
[ ]
Audit event ya bayyana ga muhimman state changes.
[ ]
Error states suna da saƙon da user zai fahimta; babu indefinite “Loading…” idan script/API ya kasa.
[ ]
Policy ta bayyana farashi/currency, scope, estimated timeline, revisions, cancellation/refund, delivery da support.
[ ]
Babu deployment har sai an kammala smoke test, Admin E2E test, network isolation test da sign-off.
11. Matakan aiwatarwa da aka ba da shawara
Phase 0 — tabbatar da halin yanzu
Bincika live production shafukan da ake amfani da su (ba repo kaɗai ba).
Tabbatar da legacy scripts da asset paths da production yake ɗauka.
Duba API gateway contract, Pi auth result shape, existing payment APIs (idan suna nan), da Admin permission primitives.
Yi rubutaccen service catalog da business decisions da aka jera a sashe na 3.
Phase 1 — ƙira da contract
Kammala request/payment state machine.
Kammala schema + RLS/grants design da API request/response contract.
Kammala policy/privacy/quote/refund wording.
Bitar ƙirar security kafin code.
Phase 2 — Testnet build
Aiwatar da schema/functions/Storage a Testnet kawai bayan amincewa.
Haɗa user form, My Requests, trusted API da Admin workflow.
Yi automated tests da end-to-end tests ta synthetic users.
Gwada negative cases: network mismatch, bad token, wrong owner, bad file, duplicate submit/payment, MFA missing, role missing, expired signed URL.
Phase 3 — Mainnet release
Review PR/diff; tabbatar da files da aka taɓa sun yi iyaka da abin da aka amince da shi.
Yi backup/rollback plan da migration verification.
Deploy zuwa Mainnet bayan Testnet pass da sign-off.
Yi smoke test a kan test request mai iyaka; tabbatar da logging/monitoring ba ya fallasa sirri.
12. Canje-canjen da ba a yarda a yi ba tare da sabon izini ba
Ba za a gyara environment-core.js, supabase-core.js, page-auth-guard.js, ko Dock Navigation ba sai wani requirement ya tilasta kuma an bayyana dalili.
Ba za a canza external-project workflow, tables ko policies ba domin su ɗauki dApp requests.
Ba za a canza Mainnet Supabase schema, policies, grants, Storage ko Edge Functions a wannan design phase ba.
Ba za a deploy, charge ainihin kuɗi, ko aika request zuwa production domin gwaji ba tare da takamaiman izini ba.
Ba za a yi wa farashi, refunds, SLA ko deliverables hasashe a matsayin hukuma ba.
13. Takaitaccen matsayi
Shawara: a yi ƙira kamar sabis mai zaman kansa, a bar Mainnet ga jama'a kaɗai, kuma a yi Testnet a matsayin wurin gwaji. A fara da tabbatar da halin production da yanke shawarar farashi/payment workflow; bayan haka a gina MVP a Testnet, a duba tsaro da Admin process, sannan a nemi izinin Mainnet deployment.
Ba a yi ba: babu repo edit, branch/commit/PR, SQL migration, Storage operation, Supabase write ko deployment a wannan mataki.
